cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: PDF Scholar
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Halseth
    given-names: Emil Mathias Strøm
repository-code: https://github.com/emilmsh/pdf-scholar
url: https://emilmsh.github.io/pdf-scholar/
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A PDF reader and annotator for Windows whose window is nearly all page, built
  for people who read to work — one slim toolbar and everything else out of the
  way until you call it, annotation tools that stay within reach without
  interrupting the reading, grounded AI assistance with clickable citations, and
  Norwegian/English UI. Available as a desktop app and a browser extension.
keywords:
  - pdf
  - annotation
  - reading
  - research-tools
  - electron
